Subject: [PATCH v8 3/4] arm64: dts: nuvoton: npcm845: Add peripheral nodes
Date: Wed,  8 Jul 2026 19:59:28 +0300
Message-Id: <20260708165929.2233934-4-tmaimon77@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
